    "system": {
        "description": {
            "value": "<p>Applied by @UUID[Compendium.isaacs-hb-pf2e.saint-techniques.Item.Chiron's Light Impulse].</p><p>You are wreathed in golden light for 1 minute. You gain a +1 status bonus to attack rolls, your attacks deal an extra @Damage[1d6[force]] damage, and you gain a fly Speed of 20 feet — equal to your own Speed once the Saint reaches 14th level.</p><p>Once during the duration, you may treat one attack roll or saving throw as though you had rolled a 10. The game offers it as a fortune option on the roll itself; taking it spends this effect's one use.</p>"
        },
